From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 853/856] feat(dsv41): enable pipeline parallelism with disk
 Engram, DSpark, and CED

Enable PP=2 (and general PP>1) on DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash with disk-backed
Engram, DSpark 5-token speculative decoding, FULL CUDA graphs, and
multi-chunk CED prefill:

- engram.py: remove the pipeline_parallel_size != 1 refusal on disk Engram.
- model.py: scope disk_engram and Engram hash registration to PP stages
  holding local Engram layers while keeping file_backed_engram true on all
  stages so DirectModelLoader skips streaming Engram tables on Stage 1;
  set supports_aux_hidden_states_over_pp = True; pack/collect aux hidden
  states through IntermediateTensors; offset _graph_out by
  _aux_slot_base_cached.
- dspark.py: instantiate VocabParallelEmbedding on non-first PP stages,
  set has_own_embed_tokens = True, add embed. to checkpoint prefixes, map
  embed.weight -> model.embed_tokens.weight, and verify it loaded.
- kv_cache_utils.py: skip projected PP KV-cache groups with empty
  layer_names in get_kv_cache_config_from_groups so UniformTypeKVCacheSpecs
  does not emit KVCacheTensors for another stage (e.g. DSpark draft KV on
  Stage 0).
- model_runner.py: gate LayerProgress with and not self.use_pp; preserve
  model_inputs[input_ids] on non-first PP stages when
  requires_raw_input_tokens is set; declare TileLang
  post_update_num_computed_tokens_calls when not self.is_last_pp_rank.
- cudagraph_utils.py: preserve model_inputs[input_ids] during CUDA graph
  capture on non-first PP stages when requires_raw_input_tokens(model).

Upstream-base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Rationale: Enables config-driven PP=2, TP=[2-4] serving on DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash without modifying PP=1 behavior.
Quality: Zero PP=1 behavior change; live PP=2, TP=2 over 200 GbE RoCE passed Sonar quality LRU 5/5, deterministic greedy c1, 44K three-chunk and 131K multi-chunk CED prefill, and full-depth DSpark acceptance (2.361 prose / 3.161 code tok/step).
Tests: Live PP=2, TP=2 verification on dgx1..dgx4 (oneshot-pp2-ring4 and nccl-socket) plus deployment unit suite (921 passed).
Upstream-status: Local DeepSeek-V4.1 pipeline parallelism enablement.
